-# Checkpoint 8
-Change: Regularized LightGBM (300 trees, lr 0.02, 15 leaves, min_child_samples 100, subsampling, L2 5) instead of defaults.
-Why: Default settings overfit a small, noisy target (about 7% positives); stronger regularization generalizes better to a later period.
-Validation PR-AUC: 0.2171 -> 0.2318
-Decision: kept, PR-AUC improved by 0.0147 (ROC-AUC 0.6701 -> 0.6816, Brier 0.1050 -> 0.1044). Hand-picked, not searched.
+# Checkpoint 9
+Change: Retried product size features without category (total weight, max package volume); reverted from FEATS.
+Why: Heavy or bulky parcels may ship slower; iteration 4 failed likely because of the category column.
+Validation PR-AUC: 0.2318 -> 0.2289 (reverted state: 0.2318)
+Decision: reverted, PR-AUC dropped 0.0029 and ROC-AUC dropped 0.6816 -> 0.6740. Product features don't help here, whether or not category is included.
